{
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.34,
      "text": " This is real flood control footage."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.44,
      "end": 6.66,
      "text": " But video alone cannot prove how much protection it provided."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.64,
      "end": 12.26,
      "text": " In February 2025, Heavy Rain hit Tennessee's Cumberland River Basin."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.28,
      "end": 14.92,
      "text": " The Army Corps published this comparison."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.88,
      "end": 18.48,
      "text": " Blue shows the river with flood projects operating."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.52,
      "end": 21.8,
      "text": " Red shows the estimated flooding without them."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.7,
      "end": 26.04,
      "text": " The red is a model estimate, not a second recorded flood."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.919999999999998,
      "end": 32.44,
      "text": " The Corps estimated $734 million in avoided damage across the basin."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.38,
      "end": 37.76,
      "text": " That was a preliminary analysis, not an independently verified count."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.16,
      "end": 44.38,
      "text": " In the Philippines, an evaluation of the IMIS project reported improvement through interviews."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.24,
      "end": 48.38,
      "text": " But comparable flooded area and household measurements were unavailable."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.8,
      "end": 52.16,
      "text": " That gap does not mean zero benefit."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.879999999999995,
      "end": 59.7,
      "text": " Ask for the event record, the with and without comparison, and checks against actual observations."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.12,
      "end": 64.5,
      "text": " How much safer, for whom and how do you know?"
    }
  ],
